epos/Hem60/PatelHem/commits/f4031cf618d9171db455e64f99ecab10f7468e1b","html_url":"https://github.com/Hem60/PatelHem/commit/f4031cf618d9171db455e64f99ecab10f7468e1b"}]},{"sha":"f4031cf618d9171db455e64f99ecab10f7468e1b","node_id":"C_kwDOUN_fV9oAKGY0MDMxY2Y2MThkOTE3MWRiNDU1ZTY0Zjk5ZWNhYjEwZjc0NjhlMWI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Hem Patel","email":"patelhem60@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-04T08:52:35Z"},"committer":{"name":"Hem Patel","email":"patelhem60@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-04T08:52:35Z"},"message":"Move the Vercel config into meridian/site\n\nThe root vercel.json did not work, and the error was misleading: \"No Next.js\nversion detected\", even with next declared in the root package.json. Vercel\ndoes not find a Next app through outputDirectory — it runs its Next builder\ninside the Root Directory, and a root with no app/ and no next.config is not\na Next app whatever its manifest says.\n\nRoot Directory is now meridian/site, set on the project, and the config lives\nbeside the app it configures. It still builds ../engine and ../pipeline first,\nwhich is the actual constraint: the site imports pipeline/dist/herald.js and\ndist/ is gitignored.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"43df3875d2f97ff8a0bf85b35806518bdd33522e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hem60/PatelHem/git/trees/43df3875d2f97ff8a0bf85b35806518bdd33522e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hem60/PatelHem/git/commits/f4031cf618d9171db455e64f99ecab10f7468e1b","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hem60/PatelHem/commits/f4031cf618d9171db455e64f99ecab10f7468e1b","html_url":"https://github.com/Hem60/PatelHem/commit/f4031cf618d9171db455e64f99ecab10f7468e1b","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hem60/PatelHem/commits/f4031cf618d9171db455e64f99ecab10f7468e1b/comments","author":{"login":"Hem60","id":227198061,"node_id":"U_kgDODYrEbQ","avatar_